'''Calañas''' ({{Langx|mxi|كَالاَنِيَاسْ|Kalańás|populous fortress}}) is a [[Cantons of Balisca|borough]] of the [[Metropolitan City of Castejón]], within the [[Concordia|Concordia conurbation]]. Located in the more rugged northwestern portion of the city, it is the fourth largest borough of Castejón by area. It is bounded by the [[Alagón river]] to the south, [[Hisbanya]] to the southwest, and the [[Calquinco]] river to the east.{{Castejón}}{{Balisca articles}}
